        <mxCell id="steps" value="&lt;b style='font-size:13px'&gt;Architecture Flow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;① Users resolve DNS via Route 53&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;② Route 53 directs traffic to ALB&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;③ ALB distributes to EC2 instances&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;④ EC2 queries RDS primary database&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;⑤ RDS replicates to standby (Multi-AZ)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;⑥ NAT Gateway provides outbound access" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fillColor=#F2F3F4;strokeColor=#E0E0E0;fontSize=12;spacing=10;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
